OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers fade
OL,6,Facross central and eastern areas,
OL,7,Fleaving a mostly dry night wit clear
OL,8,Fspells. Further west and north,
OL,9,Fshowers continue, with longer periods
OL,10,Fof rain in western and northern
OL,11,FScotland. Staying breezy and
OL,12,Frelatively mild for most.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FRain moves into the west
OL,15,Fthrough the morning. Many eastern and
OL,16,Fsoutheastern areas staying mostly dry.
OL,17,FWindy with possible coastal gales in
OL,18,Fthe north and northwest. Temperatures
OL,19,Fnear average.
